Title: SSR: textarea domProps keeps falsy values

### Version
2.6.10

### Reproduction link
[https://codesandbox.io/s/codesandbox-nuxt-vdcv8](https://codesandbox.io/s/codesandbox-nuxt-vdcv8)







### Steps to reproduce
View page source

### What is expected?
```html
<textarea id="input-62" rows="5"></textarea>
```

### What is actually happening?
```html
<textarea id="input-62" rows="5">null</textarea>
```

